Bitcoin Firm Nakamoto's Stock Hits New Low After Posting $239M Loss, Selling More BTC\nPUB: Thu, 14 May 2026 15:09:28 +0000\nLINK: https://decrypt.co/367854/bitcoin-firm-nakamoto-stock-new-low-239-million-loss-selling-btc\nDESC: Shares in Bitcoin treasury firm Nakamoto hit a new all-time low Thursday after it posted a $239 million loss and sold more BTC in Q1.\n---","cwd":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-researcher"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779103582300}}
